Subject: [PATCH 01/10] [3.1.2] [M156] [blink] Notify Oilpan per element in HeapVector
 bulk operations

Original change's description:
> [blink] Notify Oilpan per element in HeapVector bulk operations
>
> Notify Oilpan per element as each element is constructed, copied, or
> swapped in VectorTypeOperations, rather than deferring notification
> until after the loop.
